          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "der Vorschlag — \"the suggestion, the proposal\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ich habe einen Vorschlag: Wir essen heute draußen. I have a suggestion: we eat outside today."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Vorschläge. Einen Vorschlag machen — to make a suggestion."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vorschlag is the noun of vorschlagen, built from vor \"before, forward\" and schlagen \"to strike\": you put an idea forward. EtymDB has no entry for the compound, so this is the plain reading of its parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
