          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "vorschlagen is built from vor \"forward\" and schlagen \"to strike\", which is usually traced to Proto-Germanic slahaną. The sense of putting an idea forward grew out of the parts; EtymDB has no entry for the compound."
            }
          ]
